### SCENARIO: HCM is down during approval
### Stop the mock HCM server before running step 3.
### Prerequisites: run 01-seed-balances.http first, mock HCM running on :3001

### Step 1: Create a request (HCM can be running or not for this step)
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-1",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "endDate": "2026-09-03",
  "days": 2,
  "idempotencyKey": "hcm-down-001"
}

### Step 2: STOP the mock HCM server (Ctrl+C on the terminal running npm run mock:hcm)

### Step 3: Try to approve — fails with 502 (replace REQUEST_ID)
# Expected: 502 HCM_UNAVAILABLE — request stays PENDING, manager can retry
PATCH http://localhost:3000/requests/{{REQUEST_ID}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewerNote": "Approved"
}

### Step 4: Request is still PENDING — not lost, not rejected
GET http://localhost:3000/requests?employeeId=emp-1&status=PENDING

### Step 5: Restart mock HCM (npm run mock:hcm), then retry approval
### The same PATCH request should now succeed
